    "title": "\"Yankee Chronicle\"10/28/26 presented by Lake Sunapee Region VNA & Hospice - NewsBreak",
    "text": "15 hours ago\nWelcome to this week’s edition of Yankee Chronicle. I’m your host Abby Peel. Tune in today as we come to you from the Lake Sunapee Region VNA and Hospice, the preferred place to work and volunteer! It remains an adaptive and enduring presence with an unsurpassed breadth of service offerings. Today we’ll hear from Cathy Raymond about the Kearsarge Kids Christmas Program. We’ll get the monthly preview of things going on at the Abbott Library in Sunapee. We’ll get the last installment of Rick Stockton’s Bonsai series.\nRead full article",
